n":"chapter-002","block":"b-d5847039c2d504d36e8e","layer":"original","quote":"六年春二月〖1〗，遣使者循行许昌以东，尽沛郡〖2〗。问民所疾苦，贫者赈贷之。﹝一﹞三月，行幸召陵〖3〗，通讨虏渠〖4〗。乙巳〖5〗，还许昌宫。并州刺史梁习讨鲜卑轲比能〖6〗，大破之。辛未〖7〗，帝为舟师，东征。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":461,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":105,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"wendi-q-o051","section":"chapter-002","block":"b-447214b33443e877e215","layer":"original","quote":"六月，利城郡兵蔡方等以郡反，杀太守徐质。遣屯骑校尉任福、步兵校尉段昭与青州刺史讨平之〖11〗；其见胁略及亡命者〖12〗，皆赦其罪。","section_title":"文帝纪第二","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0009.xhtml","index":463,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":65,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
